{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/6997", "id": 533368226, "node_id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTMzMzY4MjI2", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/6997", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/6997.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/6997.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/6997", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/6997/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/6997/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/6997/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/statuses/6d5ce0a7fba4a9f3528c7ea7cb4e999349270b21", "number": 6997, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Remove RPC context in RpcContextTest.testObject", "user": {"login": "lzx404243", "id": 19499960, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDk5OTYw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19499960?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243", "html_url": "https://github.com/lzx404243", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## What is the purpose of the change\r\nThe test `org.apache.dubbo.rpc.RpcContextTest.testObject` is not idempotent and fails if run twice in the same JVM, because it pollutes state shared among tests. It may be good to clean this state pollution so that some other tests do not fail in the future due to the shared state polluted by this test. (See [PR #6314](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/6314) for an example of how this could cause issues)\r\n\r\n## Brief changelog\r\n\r\nIn `RpcContextTest.testObject()`, call `RpcContext.removeContext()` to clear remove the RPC context when the test finishes.\r\n\r\n## Verifying this change\r\nWith the proposed fix, the test does not pollute the shared state (and passes when run twice in the same JVM).\r\n\r\nThis fixes https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues/6996 .", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2020-12-07T04:50:06Z", "updated_at": "2021-02-22T08:22:51Z", "closed_at": "2021-02-22T08:22:50Z", "merged_at": "2021-02-22T08:22:50Z", "merge_commit_sha": "bcc721dd85a70cb05e2d9614a69b951ad37328f3", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "lzx404243:zli89-RpcContextTest-fix", "ref": "zli89-RpcContextTest-fix", "repo": {"id": 311002081, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzMTEwMDIwODE=", "name": "dubbo", "full_name": "lzx404243/dubbo", "owner": {"login": "lzx404243", "id": 19499960, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDk5OTYw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19499960?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243", "html_url": "https://github.com/lzx404243", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/subscriptions", "organiz